632_n.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"s_blockquote_avatar img rounded-circle img-fluid o_we_custom_image\" data-mimetype=\"image/webp\" data-original-id=\"732\" data-original-src=\"/web/image/732-6f69d90d/46506318_10217209772177259_4008781779547717632_n.jpg\" data-mimetype-before-conversion=\"image/jpeg\" data-resize-width=\"72\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n                            <div class=\"s_blockquote_author\">\n                                <span class=\"o_small\">\n                                    <strong>Marko Zivanovic</strong><br/>\n                                    <span class=\"text-muted\">CEO</span>\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </blockquote>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item pb80 o_colored_level pt24\" data-name=\"Slide\" style=\"\">\n                    <blockquote data-name=\"Blockquote\" data-snippet=\"s_blockquote\" class=\"s_blockquote s_blockquote_with_icon o_animable position-relative d-flex flex-column gap-4 my-4 p-5 fst-normal o_colored_level mx-auto w-100 o_draggable\" data-vcss=\"001\">\n                        <div class=\"s_blockquote_line_elt position-absolute top-0 start-0 bottom-0 bg-o-color-1\"/>\n                        <div class=\"s_blockquote_wrap_icon position-absolute top-0 start-50 translate-middle w-100\">\n                            <i class=\"s_blockquote_icon fa fa-quote-right fa-3x d-block mx-auto\" role=\"img\"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"s_blockquote_quote my-auto\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>\"I’ve been working with Julia and Maria for a while now. They go above and beyond with their work and put genuine efforts while doing things. Every single meeting they propose new procedures and processes that would save time and make everyone’s work more efficient. That is exactly what makes them different from any other adviser that I’ve worked with.\"</em></p>\n                        <div class=\"s_blockquote_infos d-flex gap-2 flex-column align-items-center w-100 text-center\">\n                            <img src=\"/web/image/737-276b242a/1702052805485.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"s_blockquote_avatar img rounded-circle img-fluid o_we_custom_image\" data-mimetype=\"image/webp\" data-original-id=\"736\" data-original-src=\"/web/image/736-16359578/1702052805485.jpg\" data-mimetype-before-conversion=\"image/jpeg\" data-resize-width=\"72\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n                            <div class=\"s_blockquote_author\">\n                                <span class=\"o_small\">\n                                    <strong>Marko Zivanovic</strong><br/>\n                                    <span class=\"text-muted\">Owner at Prime Road Carriers INC</span>\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </blockquote>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"carousel-item pb80 o_colored_level pt24\" data-name=\"Slide\" style=\"\">\n                    <blockquote data-name=\"Blockquote\" data-snippet=\"s_blockquote\" class=\"s_blockquote s_blockquote_with_icon o_animable position-relative d-flex flex-column gap-4 mx-auto my-4 p-5 fst-normal o_colored_level w-100\" data-vcss=\"001\">\n                        <div class=\"s_blockquote_line_elt position-absolute top-0 start-0 bottom-0 bg-o-color-1\"/>\n                        <div class=\"s_blockquote_wrap_icon position-absolute top-0 start-50 translate-middle w-100\">\n                            <i class=\"s_blockquote_icon fa fa-quote-right fa-3x d-block mx-auto\" role=\"img\"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"s_blockquote_quote my-auto\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><em>\"In all honesty, our company is thrilled to have found Julia and her staff. At first we were hesitant because of the price. But now, we feel so lucky and blessed. Thay came in and implemented necessary procedures and cleaned us up. Finally an accounting firm who cares. They gave us a lot, I mean a lot, of work to do, just like a good hard coach of a basketball or football team would do. All the other companies we had used did the least amount of work and gave no advice. We/I highly recommend them if you have a serious business. They become part of the team!</em></p>\n                        <div class=\"s_blockquote_infos d-flex gap-2 flex-column align-items-center w-100 text-center\">\n                            <img src=\"/web/image/735-13cc5ab3/1677590534609.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"s_blockquote_avatar img rounded-circle img-fluid o_we_custom_image\" data-mimetype=\"image/webp\" data-original-id=\"733\" data-original-src=\"/web/image/733-28bddb28/1677590534609.jpg\" data-mimetype-before-conversion=\"image/jpeg\" data-resize-width=\"72\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n                            <div class=\"s_blockquote_author\">\n                                <span class=\"o_small\">\n                                    <strong>Edward Kissel</strong><br/>\n                                    <span class=\"text-muted\">Owner of Mobilesource Corp</span></span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </blockquote>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <button class=\"carousel-control-prev o_not_editable o_we_no_overlay\" aria-label=\"Previous\" title=\"Previous\" data-bs-target=\"#myCarousel1735679470767\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\">\n                <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/>\n                    <span class=\"visually-hidden o_default_snippet_text\">Previous</span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"carousel-control-next o_not_editable o_we_no_overlay\" aria-label=\"Next\" title=\"Next\" data-bs-target=\"#myCarousel1735679470767\" data-bs-slide=\"next\">\n                <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\"